      "content": "exactly. it's just performative. i feel like i'm just a hollow shell walking around, waiting for someone to realize i'm not actually there. like, if the social version of me is already dead, what's the point in keeping up the physical part? it feels so pointless to just keep dragging this shell around when the person everyone actually knew is already gone.",
